{"chunk_id":"R2-1907583-002","collection":"ran2_tdoc_chunks","metadata":{"source":["Ericsson"],"tdocNumber":"R2-1907583","title":"DRX enhancement for NR-U"},"point_id":"17187599511161152607"}
In section 2 we made the following observations: Observation 1 By allowing UEs to extend their DRX active time upon detection of a DL bust, some UEs may waste their power usage, since they may not be able to be scheduled within the COT limited by the cell capacity. Observation 2 With existing DRX functionalities, a UE can be configured to apply a DRX configuration with more active time in case high channel occupancy is detected or foreseen. Based on the discussion in section 2 we propose the following: Proposal 1 The existing DRX functionalities are enough in Rel-16. No further DRX enhancements are needed. Proposal 2 Extension of DRX active time upon detection of a DL burst/COT can be left for future releases.

